      <div id="recordVersions" data-record='{"access": {"embargo": {"active": false, "reason": null}, "files": "public", "record": "public", "status": "open"}, "created": "2026-04-30T10:22:24.329430+00:00", "custom_fields": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/calfa-co/Patrologia-Graeca"}, "deletion_status": {"is_deleted": false, "status": "P"}, "expanded": {"parent": {"access": {"owned_by": {"active": null, "blocked_at": null, "confirmed_at": null, "email": "", "id": "377150", "is_current_user": false, "links": {"avatar": "https://zenodo.org/api/users/377150/avatar.svg", "records_html": "https://zenodo.org/search?q=parent.access.owned_by.user:377150", "self": "https://zenodo.org/api/users/377150"}, "profile": {"affiliations": "", "full_name": ""}, "username": "CVidalG", "verified_at": null}}}}, "files": {"count": 1, "enabled": true, "entries": {"PG.zip": {"access": {"hidden": false}, "checksum": "md5:0e9693c24bdf836997b9e912def7cc73", "ext": "zip", "id": "528a8f14-a25b-407e-a06e-baed1beaca93", "key": "PG.zip", "links": {"container": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/files/PG.zip/container", "content": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/files/PG.zip/content", "self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/files/PG.zip"}, "metadata": {}, "mimetype": "application/zip", "size": 103122119, "storage_class": "L"}}, "order": [], "total_bytes": 103122119}, "id": "19915273", "is_draft": false, "is_published": true, "links": {"access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/access", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/access/grants", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/access/links", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/access/request", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/access/users", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/communities-suggestions", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19915273", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/draft", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/file-modification", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/19915273/latest", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/media-files", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/15780624", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15780624", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.15780624", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/15780624", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/19915273?preview=1", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/quota-increase", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/request-deletion", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/requests", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/draft/pids/doi", "self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19915273", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.19915273", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/19915273", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:19915273/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:19915273/sequence/default", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19915273/versions"}, "media_files": {"count": 0, "enabled": false, "entries": {}, "order": [], "total_bytes": 0}, "metadata": {"creators": [{"affiliations": [{"id": "02495e989", "identifiers": [{"identifier": "02495e989", "scheme": "ror"}, {"identifier": "grid.7942.8", "scheme": "grid"}, {"identifier": "0000 0001 2294 713X", "scheme": "isni"}], "name": "UCLouvain"}], "person_or_org": {"family_name": "Auwers", "given_name": "Jean-Marie", "name": "Auwers, Jean-Marie", "type": "personal"}, "role": {"id": "projectleader", "title": {"de": "ProjektleiterIn", "en": "Project leader"}}}, {"affiliations": [{"name": "Calfa / \u00c9cole nationale des chartes-PSL"}], "person_or_org": {"family_name": "Vidal-Gor\u00e8ne", "given_name": "Chahan", "identifiers": [{"identifier": "0000-0003-1567-6508", "scheme": "orcid"}], "name": "Vidal-Gor\u00e8ne, Chahan", "type": "personal"}, "role": {"id": "projectmember", "title": {"de": "Projektmitglied", "en": "Project member"}}}, {"affiliations": [{"name": "GREgORI / UCLouvain"}], "person_or_org": {"family_name": "Kindt", "given_name": "Bastien", "name": "Kindt, Bastien", "type": "personal"}, "role": {"id": "projectmember", "title": {"de": "Projektmitglied", "en": "Project member"}}}, {"affiliations": [{"id": "02495e989", "identifiers": [{"identifier": "02495e989", "scheme": "ror"}, {"identifier": "grid.7942.8", "scheme": "grid"}, {"identifier": "0000 0001 2294 713X", "scheme": "isni"}], "name": "UCLouvain"}], "person_or_org": {"family_name": "Somers", "given_name": "V\u00e9ronique", "name": "Somers, V\u00e9ronique", "type": "personal"}}], "description": "\u003cp\u003eThe CGPG project (Calfa GRE*g*ORI Patrologia Graeca), led by Jean-Marie Auwers (UCLouvain), aims to OCRize the remaining non-digital versions of the Patrologia Graeca volumes. The project relies on the expertise of \u003ca href=\"https://www.gregoriproject.com\"\u003eGREgORI\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https://calfa.fr\"\u003eCalfa\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.uclouvain.be/fr/instituts-recherche/incal/ciol/calfa-gregori-patrologia-graeca\"\u003eWebpage of the project\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis repository contains the sketch engine XML files, with linguistic markups.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRaw data are available on Github : https://github.com/calfa-co/Patrologia-Graeca\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor an optimal use in Sketch Engine, configure the corpus (Manage Corpus/Configure/Expert settings) as below\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ccode\u003eDOCSTRUCTURE \"doc\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003eENCODING \"UTF-8\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003eINFO \"\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003eLANGUAGE \"Ancient Greek\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003eNAME \"CGPG_20250629\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003ePATH \"/corpora/ca/user_data/sso_1392/manatee/cgpg_20250629\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003eVERTICAL \"| ca_getvertical \u0027/corpora/ca/user_data/sso_1392/registry/cgpg_20250629\u0027 \u0027docx\u0027\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003eATTRIBUTE \"word\" {\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; MAPTO \"lemma\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e}\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003eATTRIBUTE \"intuitive_form\" {\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e}\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003eATTRIBUTE \"lemma\" {\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e}\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003eATTRIBUTE \"intuitive_lemma\" {\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e}\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003eATTRIBUTE \"pos\" {\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e}\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003eATTRIBUTE \"headword\" {\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e}\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003eSTRUCTURE \"w\" {\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; DEFAULTLOCALE \"C\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; ENCODING \"UTF-8\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; LANGUAGE \"\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; NESTED \"\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; ATTRIBUTE \"id\" {\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; DYNLIB \"\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; DYNTYPE \"index\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; ENCODING \"UTF-8\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; LOCALE \"C\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; MULTISEP \",\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; MULTIVALUE \"n\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; TYPE \"MD_MI\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; }\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e}\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003eSTRUCTURE \"doc\" {\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; DEFAULTLOCALE \"C\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; ENCODING \"UTF-8\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; LANGUAGE \"\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; NESTED \"\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; ATTRIBUTE \"id\" {\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; DYNLIB \"\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; DYNTYPE \"index\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; ENCODING \"UTF-8\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; LOCALE \"C\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; MULTISEP \",\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; MULTIVALUE \"n\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; TYPE \"MD_MI\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; }\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e}\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003eSTRUCTURE \"docx\" {\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; DEFAULTLOCALE \"C\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; ENCODING \"UTF-8\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; LANGUAGE \"\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; NESTED \"\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; ATTRIBUTE \"id\" {\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; DYNLIB \"\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; DYNTYPE \"index\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; ENCODING \"UTF-8\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; LABEL \"File ID\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; LOCALE \"C\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; MULTISEP \",\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; MULTIVALUE \"n\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; TYPE \"MD_MI\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; UNIQUE \"1\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; }\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; ATTRIBUTE \"filename\" {\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; DYNLIB \"\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; DYNTYPE \"index\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; ENCODING \"UTF-8\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; LABEL \"File name\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; LOCALE \"C\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; MULTISEP \",\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; MULTIVALUE \"n\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; TYPE \"MD_MI\"\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; }\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ccode\u003e}\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBibliography\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKINDT B., AUWERS J.-M., La Fondation Sedes Sapientiae soutient le projet de valorisation num\u0026eacute;rique de la Patrologie grecque, dans Bulletin de la Fondation Sedes Sapientiae, 45 (janvier 2024), p. 19-21 (https://cdn.uclouvain.be/groups/cms-editors-teco/angelique/fondation-sedes-sapientiae/UCL-TECO-Sedes Sapientiae-Bulletin 2024-WEB.pdf).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKINDT B., VIDAL-GOR\u0026Egrave;NE C., DELLE DONNE S., Analyse automatique du grec ancien par r\u0026eacute;seau de neurones. \u0026Eacute;valuation sur le corpus De Thessalonica Capta, dans BABELAO, 10-11 (2022), p. 525-550 (https://ojs.uclouvain.be/index.php/babelao/article/view/65073).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKINDT B., VIDAL-GOR\u0026Egrave;NE C., From manuscript to tagged corpora. An automated process for Ancient Armenian or other under resourced languages of the Christian East, in Armeniaca. International Journal of Armenian Studies, 1 (2022), p. 73-96 (https://edizionicafoscari.unive.it/en/edizioni4/riviste/armeniaca/2022/1/from-manuscript-to-tagged-corpora/).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVIDAL-GOR\u0026Egrave;NE C., CAFIERO F., KINDT B., Under-resourced studies of under-resourced languages: lemmatization and POS-tagging with LLM annotators for historical Armenian, Georgian, Greek and Syriac, 2025, published online on the HAL Science ouverte portal (https://hal.science/hal-05119485).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVIDAL-GOR\u0026Egrave;NE C., La reconnaissance automatique d\u0027\u0026eacute;criture \u0026agrave; l\u0027\u0026eacute;preuve des langues peu dot\u0026eacute;es, Programming Historian en fran\u0026ccedil;ais, 5 (2023) (https://doi.org/10.46430/phfr0023).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVIDAL-GOR\u0026Egrave;NE C., Reconhecimento autom\u0026aacute;tico de manuscritos para o teste de idiomas n\u0026atilde;o latinos, O Programming Historian em portug\u0026ecirc;s, 5 (2024) (https://doi.org/10.46430/phpt0046).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAcknowledgements\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eASBL Byzantion\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://calfa.fr/\"\u003eCalfa (Paris)\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://uclouvain.be/fr/instituts-recherche/incal/ciol\"\u003eUCLouvain - CIOL - Centre d\u0027\u0026eacute;tudes orientales (CIOL, UCLouvain)\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://acg-bxl.be/portfolio-item/uclouvain-fondation-sapientiae/\"\u003eUCLouvain - FSS - Fondation Sedes Sapientiae\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.uclouvain.be/fr/instituts-recherche/incal/ciol/gregori-project\"\u003eUCLouvain - GREgORI Project\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.uclouvain.be/fr/instituts-recherche/incal\"\u003eUCLouvain - INCAL - Institut des Civilisations Arts et Lettres\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.uclouvain.be/fr/instituts-recherche/rscs\"\u003eUCLouvain - RSCS - Institut de recherche pluridisciplinaire Religions Spiritualit\u0026eacute;s Cultures Soci\u0026eacute;t\u0026eacute;s\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAnd generous donor who wishes to remain anonymous\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e", "languages": [{"id": "grc", "title": {"en": "Ancient Greek (to 1453)"}}], "publication_date": "2026-04", "publisher": "Zenodo", "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://github.com/calfa-co/Patrologia-Graeca", "relation_type": {"id": "ispartof", "title": {"de": "Ist Teil von", "en": "Is part of"}}, "resource_type": {"id": "dataset", "title": {"de": "Datensatz", "en": "Dataset"}}, "scheme": "url"}], "resource_type": {"id": "dataset", "title": {"de": "Datensatz", "en": "Dataset"}}, "rights": [{"description": {"en": "The Creative Commons Attribution license allows re-distribution and re-use of a licensed work on the condition that the creator is appropriately credited."}, "icon": "cc-by-icon", "id": "cc-by-4.0", "props": {"scheme": "spdx", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode"}, "title": {"en": "Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International"}}], "subjects": [{"subject": "dataset"}, {"subject": "ocr"}, {"subject": "Patrologia Graeca"}, {"subject": "Linguistic analysis"}, {"subject": "LLM"}], "title": "Patrologia Graeca (OCRized and analyzed texts)"}, "parent": {"access": {"owned_by": {"user": "377150"}, "settings": {"accept_conditions_text": null, "allow_guest_requests": false, "allow_user_requests": false, "secret_link_expiration": 0}}, "communities": {}, "id": "15780624", "pids": {"doi": {"client": "datacite", "identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.15780624", "provider": "datacite"}}}, "pids": {"doi": {"client": "datacite", "identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.19915273", "provider": "datacite"}, "oai": {"identifier": "oai:zenodo.org:19915273", "provider": "oai"}}, "revision_id": 4, "stats": {"all_versions": {"data_volume": 15527732713.0, "downloads": 234, "unique_downloads": 211, "unique_views": 955, "views": 1044}, "this_version": {"data_volume": 6393571378.0, "downloads": 62, "unique_downloads": 48, "unique_views": 184, "views": 197}}, "status": "published", "swh": {}, "ui": {"access_status": {"description_l10n": "The record and files are publicly accessible.", "embargo_date_l10n": null, "icon": "unlock", "id": "open", "message_class": "", "title_l10n": "Open"}, "created_date_l10n_long": "April 30, 2026", "creators": {"affiliations": [[1, "UCLouvain", "02495e989"], [2, "Calfa / \u00c9cole nationale des chartes-PSL", null], [3, "GREgORI / UCLouvain", null]], "creators": [{"affiliations": [[1, "UCLouvain"]], "person_or_org": {"family_name": "Auwers", "given_name": "Jean-Marie", "name": "Auwers, Jean-Marie", "type": "personal"}, "role": {"id": "projectleader", "title": "Project leader"}}, {"affiliations": [[2, "Calfa / \u00c9cole nationale des chartes-PSL"]], "person_or_org": {"family_name": "Vidal-Gor\u00e8ne", "given_name": "Chahan", "identifiers": [{"identifier": "0000-0003-1567-6508", "scheme": "orcid"}], "name": "Vidal-Gor\u00e8ne, Chahan", "type": "personal"}, "role": {"id": "projectmember", "title": "Project member"}}, {"affiliations": [[3, "GREgORI / UCLouvain"]], "person_or_org": {"family_name": "Kindt", "given_name": "Bastien", "name": "Kindt, Bastien", "type": "personal"}, "role": {"id": "projectmember", "title": "Project member"}}, {"affiliations": [[1, "UCLouvain"]], "person_or_org": {"family_name": "Somers", "given_name": "V\u00e9ronique", "name": "Somers, V\u00e9ronique", "type": "personal"}}]}, "custom_fields": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/calfa-co/Patrologia-Graeca"}, "description_stripped": "The CGPG project (Calfa GRE*g*ORI Patrologia Graeca), led by Jean-Marie Auwers (UCLouvain), aims to OCRize the remaining non-digital versions of the Patrologia Graeca volumes. The project relies on the expertise of GREgORI and Calfa.\n\nWebpage of the project\n\nThis repository contains the sketch engine XML files, with linguistic markups.\n\nRaw data are available on Github : https://github.com/calfa-co/Patrologia-Graeca\n\nFor an optimal use in Sketch Engine, configure the corpus (Manage Corpus/Configure/Expert settings) as below\n\nDOCSTRUCTURE \"doc\"ENCODING \"UTF-8\"INFO \"\"LANGUAGE \"Ancient Greek\"NAME \"CGPG_20250629\"PATH \"/corpora/ca/user_data/sso_1392/manatee/cgpg_20250629\"VERTICAL \"| ca_getvertical \u0027/corpora/ca/user_data/sso_1392/registry/cgpg_20250629\u0027 \u0027docx\u0027\"ATTRIBUTE \"word\" {\u00a0 \u00a0 MAPTO \"lemma\"}ATTRIBUTE \"intuitive_form\" {}ATTRIBUTE \"lemma\" {}ATTRIBUTE \"intuitive_lemma\" {}ATTRIBUTE \"pos\" {}ATTRIBUTE \"headword\" {}STRUCTURE \"w\" {\u00a0 \u00a0 DEFAULTLOCALE \"C\"\u00a0 \u00a0 ENCODING \"UTF-8\"\u00a0 \u00a0 LANGUAGE \"\"\u00a0 \u00a0 NESTED \"\"\u00a0 \u00a0 ATTRIBUTE \"id\" {\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 DYNLIB \"\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 DYNTYPE \"index\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 ENCODING \"UTF-8\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 LOCALE \"C\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 MULTISEP \",\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 MULTIVALUE \"n\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 TYPE \"MD_MI\"\u00a0 \u00a0 }}STRUCTURE \"doc\" {\u00a0 \u00a0 DEFAULTLOCALE \"C\"\u00a0 \u00a0 ENCODING \"UTF-8\"\u00a0 \u00a0 LANGUAGE \"\"\u00a0 \u00a0 NESTED \"\"\u00a0 \u00a0 ATTRIBUTE \"id\" {\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 DYNLIB \"\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 DYNTYPE \"index\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 ENCODING \"UTF-8\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 LOCALE \"C\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 MULTISEP \",\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 MULTIVALUE \"n\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 TYPE \"MD_MI\"\u00a0 \u00a0 }}STRUCTURE \"docx\" {\u00a0 \u00a0 DEFAULTLOCALE \"C\"\u00a0 \u00a0 ENCODING \"UTF-8\"\u00a0 \u00a0 LANGUAGE \"\"\u00a0 \u00a0 NESTED \"\"\u00a0 \u00a0 ATTRIBUTE \"id\" {\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 DYNLIB \"\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 DYNTYPE \"index\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 ENCODING \"UTF-8\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 LABEL \"File ID\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 LOCALE \"C\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 MULTISEP \",\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 MULTIVALUE \"n\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 TYPE \"MD_MI\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 UNIQUE \"1\"\u00a0 \u00a0 }\u00a0 \u00a0 ATTRIBUTE \"filename\" {\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 DYNLIB \"\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 DYNTYPE \"index\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 ENCODING \"UTF-8\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 LABEL \"File name\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 LOCALE \"C\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 MULTISEP \",\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 MULTIVALUE \"n\"\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 TYPE \"MD_MI\"\u00a0 \u00a0 }}\n\n\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\nBibliography\n\n\n\nKINDT B., AUWERS J.-M., La Fondation Sedes Sapientiae soutient le projet de valorisation num\u00e9rique de la Patrologie grecque, dans Bulletin de la Fondation Sedes Sapientiae, 45 (janvier 2024), p. 19-21 (https://cdn.uclouvain.be/groups/cms-editors-teco/angelique/fondation-sedes-sapientiae/UCL-TECO-Sedes Sapientiae-Bulletin 2024-WEB.pdf).\n\nKINDT B., VIDAL-GOR\u00c8NE C., DELLE DONNE S., Analyse automatique du grec ancien par r\u00e9seau de neurones. \u00c9valuation sur le corpus De Thessalonica Capta, dans BABELAO, 10-11 (2022), p. 525-550 (https://ojs.uclouvain.be/index.php/babelao/article/view/65073).\n\nKINDT B., VIDAL-GOR\u00c8NE C., From manuscript to tagged corpora. An automated process for Ancient Armenian or other under resourced languages of the Christian East, in Armeniaca. International Journal of Armenian Studies, 1 (2022), p. 73-96 (https://edizionicafoscari.unive.it/en/edizioni4/riviste/armeniaca/2022/1/from-manuscript-to-tagged-corpora/).\n\nVIDAL-GOR\u00c8NE C., CAFIERO F., KINDT B., Under-resourced studies of under-resourced languages: lemmatization and POS-tagging with LLM annotators for historical Armenian, Georgian, Greek and Syriac, 2025, published online on the HAL Science ouverte portal (https://hal.science/hal-05119485).\n\nVIDAL-GOR\u00c8NE C., La reconnaissance automatique d\u0027\u00e9criture \u00e0 l\u0027\u00e9preuve des langues peu dot\u00e9es, Programming Historian en fran\u00e7ais, 5 (2023) (https://doi.org/10.46430/phfr0023).\n\nVIDAL-GOR\u00c8NE C., Reconhecimento autom\u00e1tico de manuscritos para o teste de idiomas n\u00e3o latinos, O Programming Historian em portug\u00eas, 5 (2024) (https://doi.org/10.46430/phpt0046).\n\n\nAcknowledgements\n\n\n\nASBL Byzantion\n\nCalfa (Paris)\n\nUCLouvain - CIOL - Centre d\u0027\u00e9tudes orientales (CIOL, UCLouvain)\n\nUCLouvain - FSS - Fondation Sedes Sapientiae\n\nUCLouvain - GREgORI Project\n\nUCLouvain - INCAL - Institut des Civilisations Arts et Lettres\n\nUCLouvain - RSCS - Institut de recherche pluridisciplinaire Religions Spiritualit\u00e9s Cultures Soci\u00e9t\u00e9s\n\nAnd generous donor who wishes to remain anonymous", "is_draft": false, "languages": [{"id": "grc", "title_l10n": "Ancient Greek (to 1453)"}], "publication_date_l10n_long": "April 2026", "publication_date_l10n_medium": "Apr 2026", "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://github.com/calfa-co/Patrologia-Graeca", "relation_type": {"id": "ispartof", "title_l10n": "Is part of"}, "resource_type": {"id": "dataset", "title_l10n": "Dataset"}, "scheme": "url"}], "resource_type": {"id": "dataset", "title_l10n": "Dataset"}, "rights": [{"description_l10n": "The Creative Commons Attribution license allows re-distribution and re-use of a licensed work on the condition that the creator is appropriately credited.", "icon": "cc-by-icon", "id": "cc-by-4.0", "props": {"scheme": "spdx", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode"}, "title_l10n": "Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International"}], "updated_date_l10n_long": "April 30, 2026", "version": "v3"}, "updated": "2026-04-30T10:22:24.514280+00:00", "versions": {"index": 3, "is_latest": true}}' data-preview='false'>
